# File: .gitignore
# ⚡ COMP-OS — REPOSITORY SHIELD CONTRACT
# =============================================================================
# FILE          : .gitignore
# RESPONSIBILITY: Git Air-Gap Defense & Secret Leak Prevention
# OWNERSHIP     : DevOps Core / Security
# DOMAIN        : Infrastructure
# LAYER         : Version Control (L0)
# RISK LEVEL    : CRITICAL (Secret Protection & Repo Integrity)
# =============================================================================
#
# RELEASE METADATA
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VERSION       : v1.0.0 (ABSOLUTE-ZERO-STABLE)
# REVISION ID   : INFRA-GIT-001
# RELEASE TAG   : PRODUCTION-SHIELD-GOLD
# LAST UPDATE   : 2026-02-20
# STATUS        : ENFORCED
#
# ARCHITECTURAL MANDATES:
# 1. SECURITY VAULT: Mandatory blocking of all .env variants and private keys.
# 2. DATA QUARANTINE: Prevents heavy database dumps (.sql, .db) from bloating history.
# 3. AUDIO GATING: whitelists UI-critical sound triggers while blocking bulk media.
# 4. WORKSPACE HYGIENE: Syncs shared team IDE settings while ignoring local state.
#
# =============================================================================
# INTENT & RESPONSIBILITY
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines the "Forbidden Zone" for version control. It is the first 
# line of defense against accidental PII leaks and the ingestion of large 
# binary artifacts that degrade cloning performance.
#
# CONTRACT:
# 1. NO SECRETS: Any file containing VITE_ keys (except .example) is blocked.
# 2. NO BLOAT: Media files exceeding 1MB (except UI cues) must be hosted on CDN.
# 3. NO TRASH: OS-specific and IDE-local cache files are strictly quarantined.
#
# CHANGELOG:
# - v1.0.0: Initial stable release. Implemented refined Audio Gating for 
# SoundNexus UI cues and strict Supabase branch isolation.
#
# =============================================================================
# * ARCHITECTURE:
# 1. EXCEPTION MAPPING: Uses negative lookaheads (!) to allow .env.example 
# and UI-specific sounds while maintaining a blanket block on sensitive siblings.
# 2. BRANCH ISOLATION: Explicitly ignores Supabase temporary folders to 
# prevent local dev-state collisions during remote deployment.
# * =============================================================================

# 📦 DEPENDENCIES & KERNEL CACHE
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.vite/
.eslintcache
.prettiercache
.stylelintcache
.turbo/
.cache/
.parcel-cache

# 🏗️ BUILD ARTIFACTS (STAGING & PRODUCTION)
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
out/
package-lock.json.log
dist_stats.html
bundle-stats.html
stats.html

# 🔐 SECURITY VAULT (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.production
.env.local
.env.local.*
.env.staging
.env.test
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
secrets.json
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/functions/.import_map.json
supabase/tmp/

# 💾 DATA & BACKUPS (PREVENTS ACCIDENTAL LEAKS)
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.tmp
*.temp

# 🎮 TOURNAMENT HARD-FILES & 3D ASSETS
public/assets/raw-3d/
public/assets/audio-stems/
*.mp4
*.dem
*.mov
*.glb
*.gltf
*.obj
*.zip
*.7z

# 🔉 AUDIO GATING
# Block heavy audio files to keep repo size small (<1GB)
*.wav
*.mp3
# ALLOW exception for tiny UI sound effects (SoundNexus)
!public/sounds/ui/*.mp3
!public/sounds/ui/*.wav

# 🛠️ IDE & WORKSPACE PREFERENCES
.idea/
.vscode/*
# ALLOW core team workspace settings to sync
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# 🖥️ OS & SYSTEM TRASH
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Icon?

# 🧪 TESTING & COVERAGE
coverage/
*.lcov
.nyc_output
cypress/videos/
cypress/screenshots/

# ☁️ CLOUD PLATFORM ARTIFACTS
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
.turbo

# 📝 LOGS & TELEMETRY
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
